"""
NVR SyncGuard v4.4.0
Automated NVR Time Synchronization & Camera Health Monitoring
Developed by Codraze

v4.4.0 CHANGES:
  - Daily auto-restart at a configurable time (default 08:30) with HH:MM
    setting + checkbox in the Settings panel.
  - Hiding the left menu now lets the right side fill the full window.
  - Ping monitor pings EVERY NVR each cycle (parallel TCP check) and logs
    every result to the Ping monitor panel.
  - Repeating "still offline" notification (default every 5 min) for any
    NVR / camera that is down.
  - Background / recovery scans now stream their output to the Activity log
    and camera table in the UI (same as the terminal log).
  - Per-NVR time and total scan time are logged and shown after completion.

Preserved from prior versions:
  - Single Chrome session reused across all NVRs per run.
  - Per-NVR login; time sync + camera scan in one session.
  - NVR retry with increasing waits before skipping.
  - Robust click strategies (native -> JS -> synthetic events).
  - Excel report on every run.
  - Admin password protection.
  - Autostart with Windows.
"""

